WEBVTT

00:00:01.121 --> 00:00:10.676
Papers keep their results in tables and equations. TEZAUR can pull both out of a PDF's text layer.

00:00:10.726 --> 00:00:18.279
tables prints each table as Markdown (or CSV with -o, one file per table).

00:00:18.329 --> 00:00:25.349
equations finds display equations and their numbers, as LaTeX-style text.

00:00:25.399 --> 00:00:35.357
It is a heuristic: single-line equations work, stacked fractions and matrices are not reconstructed. Check against the page.
